.TH SDL_FlashWindow 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_FlashWindow \- Request a window to demand attention from the user.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_video.h>
.PP
.BI "bool SDL_FlashWindow(SDL_Window *window, SDL_FlashOperation operation);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I window
the window to be flashed\[char46]
.TP
.I operation
the operation to perform\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns true on success or false on failure; call
.BR SDL_GetError ()
for more information\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
This function should only be called on the main thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

